{"page":39,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:238","surah":2,"ayah":238,"ar_uthmani":"حَـٰفِظُوا۟ عَلَى ٱلصَّلَوَٰتِ وَٱلصَّلَوٰةِ ٱلْوُسْطَىٰ وَقُومُوا۟ لِلَّهِ قَـٰنِتِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Take care to do your prayers, praying in the best way, and stand before God in devotion.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"حَـٰفِظُوا۟","en_gloss":"Guard strictly","transliteration":"ḥāfiẓū","verse_key":"2:238"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"[on]","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"2:238"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلصَّلَوَٰتِ","en_gloss":"the prayers","transliteration":"l-ṣalawāti","verse_key":"2:238"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","en_gloss":"and the prayer ","transliteration":"wal-ṣalati","verse_key":"2:238"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْوُسْطَىٰ","en_gloss":"[the] middle","transliteration":"l-wus'ṭā","verse_key":"2:238"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَقُومُوا۟","en_gloss":"and stand up","transliteration":"waqūmū","verse_key":"2:238"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِلَّهِ","en_gloss":"for Allah","transliteration":"lillahi","verse_key":"2:238"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَـٰنِتِينَ","en_gloss":"devoutly obedient","transliteration":"qānitīna","verse_key":"2:238"},{"pos":9,"ar":"٢٣٨","en_gloss":"(238)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:238"}]},{"verse_key":"2:239","surah":2,"ayah":239,"ar_uthmani":"فَإِنْ خِفْتُمْ فَرِجَالًا أَوْ رُكْبَانًا ۖ فَإِذَآ أَمِنتُمْ فَٱذْكُرُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ كَمَا عَلَّمَكُم مَّا لَمْ تَكُونُوا۟ تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If you are in danger, pray when you are out walking or riding; when you are safe again, remember God, for He has taught you what you did not know.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَإِنْ","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":2,"ar":"خِفْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you fear","transliteration":"khif'tum","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فَرِجَالًا","en_gloss":"then (pray) on foot","transliteration":"farijālan","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أَوْ","en_gloss":"or","transliteration":"aw","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رُكْبَانًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"riding","transliteration":"ruk'bānan","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فَإِذَآ","en_gloss":"Then when","transliteration":"fa-idhā","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَمِنتُمْ","en_gloss":"you are secure","transliteration":"amintum","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":8,"ar":"فَٱذْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"then remember","transliteration":"fa-udh'kurū","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"as","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَلَّمَكُم","en_gloss":"He (has) taught you","transliteration":"ʿallamakum","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":14,"ar":"تَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"you were","transliteration":"takūnū","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"knowing","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"2:239"},{"pos":16,"ar":"٢٣٩","en_gloss":"(239)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:239"}]},{"verse_key":"2:240","surah":2,"ayah":240,"ar_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ يُتَوَفَّوْنَ مِنكُمْ وَيَذَرُونَ أَزْوَٰجًا وَصِيَّةً لِّأَزْوَٰجِهِم مَّتَـٰعًا إِلَى ٱلْحَوْلِ غَيْرَ إِخْرَاجٍ ۚ فَإِنْ خَرَجْنَ فَلَا جُنَاحَ عَلَيْكُمْ فِى مَا فَعَلْنَ فِىٓ أَنفُسِهِنَّ مِن مَّعْرُوفٍ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ عَزِيزٌ حَكِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"If any of you die and leave widows, make a bequest for them: a year’s maintenance and no expulsion from their homes [for that time]. But if they leave of their own accord, you will not be blamed for what they may reasonably choose to do with themselves: God is almighty and wise.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يُتَوَفَّوْنَ","en_gloss":"die","transliteration":"yutawaffawna","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَيَذَرُونَ","en_gloss":"and leave behind","transliteration":"wayadharūna","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَزْوَٰجًۭا","en_gloss":"(their) wives","transliteration":"azwājan","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَصِيَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"(should make) a will","transliteration":"waṣiyyatan","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":7,"ar":"لِّأَزْوَٰجِهِم","en_gloss":"for their wives","transliteration":"li-azwājihim","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مَّتَـٰعًا","en_gloss":"provision","transliteration":"matāʿan","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِلَى","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْحَوْلِ","en_gloss":"the year","transliteration":"l-ḥawli","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":11,"ar":"غَيْرَ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"ghayra","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِخْرَاجٍۢ ۚ","en_gloss":"driving (them) out","transliteration":"ikh'rājin","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَإِنْ","en_gloss":"But if","transliteration":"fa-in","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":14,"ar":"خَرَجْنَ","en_gloss":"they leave","transliteration":"kharajna","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَلَا","en_gloss":"then no","transliteration":"falā","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":16,"ar":"جُنَاحَ","en_gloss":"blame","transliteration":"junāḥa","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":17,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":19,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":20,"ar":"فَعَلْنَ","en_gloss":"they do","transliteration":"faʿalna","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":21,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"concerning","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":22,"ar":"أَنفُسِهِنَّ","en_gloss":"themselves","transliteration":"anfusihinna","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":23,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:240"},{"pos":24,"ar":"مَّعْرُوفٍ