َلِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Fight in God’s cause and remember that He is all hearing and all knowing.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَـٰتِلُوا۟","en_gloss":"And fight","transliteration":"waqātilū","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":3,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":5,"ar":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and know","transliteration":"wa-iʿ'lamū","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَنَّ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"anna","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":8,"ar":"سَمِيعٌ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Hearing","transliteration":"samīʿun","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"All-Knowing","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","verse_key":"2:244"},{"pos":10,"ar":"٢٤٤","en_gloss":"(244)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:244"}]},{"verse_key":"2:245","surah":2,"ayah":245,"ar_uthmani":"مَّن ذَا ٱلَّذِى يُقْرِضُ ٱللَّهَ قَرْضًا حَسَنًا فَيُضَـٰعِفَهُۥ لَهُۥٓ أَضْعَافًا كَثِيرَةً ۚ وَٱللَّهُ يَقْبِضُ وَيَبْصُۜطُ وَإِلَيْهِ تُرْجَعُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Who will give God a good loan, which He will increase for him many times over? It is God who withholds and God who gives abundantly, and it is to Him that you will return.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"Who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:245"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ذَا","en_gloss":"(is) the one","transliteration":"dhā","verse_key":"2:245"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلَّذِى","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhī","verse_key":"2:245"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُقْرِضُ","en_gloss":"will lend","transliteration":"yuq'riḍu","verse_key":"2:245"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(to) Allah ","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:245"},{"pos":6,"ar":"قَرْضًا","en_gloss":"a loan","transliteration"